  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">221822 DEC Ukraine Humanitarian Response (Phase 2b) Romania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has been created in direct response to the request of the Romanian team. The previous combined project encompassing phases 2a and 2b has undergone a division into two distinct endeavours, one for each respective phase. The previous project has been renamed for Phase 2a and this one has Phase 2b name.
 
 This division was primarily initiated by the transition of the former Finance Officer, who oversaw operations for both Romania and Moldova, to a dedicated role within the Moldova team. In turn, the Romanian team has hired a new Finance Officer. To ensure a clear demarcation of projects and responsibilities, the decision was made to allocate a unique PIBAS number exclusively for the Romanian team, before that it was the same PIBAS number for the two countries. Consequently, the initiation of a new project within the PIMS becomes a necessary step.</narrative>
  </description>
